{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 13,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 386.621,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.74,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now when the king had heard these words,",
      "verse": "13:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.92,
      "end": 4.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he said unto his priests:",
      "verse": "13:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 4.772,
      "end": 7.094,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Away with this fellow, and slay him;",
      "verse": "13:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 7.274,
      "end": 9.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for what have we to do with him,",
      "verse": "13:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 9.451,
      "end": 10.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he is mad.",
      "verse": "13:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 11.524,
      "end": 14.775,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they stood forth and attempted to lay their hands on him;",
      "verse": "13:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 14.955,
      "end": 16.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but he withstood them,",
      "verse": "13:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 16.714,
      "end": 18.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said unto them:",
      "verse": "13:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 19.019,
      "end": 20.412,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Touch me not,",
      "verse": "13:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 20.592,
      "end": 23.982,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for God shall smite you if ye lay your hands upon me,",
      "verse": "13:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 24.162,
      "end": 28.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have not delivered the message which the Lord sent me to deliver;",
      "verse": "13:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 28.382,
      "end": 32.794,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither have I told you that which ye requested that I should tell;",
      "verse": "13:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 32.974,
      "end": 37.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, God will not suffer that I shall be destroyed at this time.",
      "verse": "13:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 38.298,
      "end": 41.874,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I must fulfil the commandments wherewith God has commanded me;",
      "verse": "13:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 42.054,
      "end": 44.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because I have told you the truth",
      "verse": "13:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 44.51,
      "end": 46.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye are angry with me.",
      "verse": "13:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 46.223,
      "end": 49.752,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, because I have spoken the word of God",
      "verse": "13:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 49.932,
      "end": 52.068,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye have judged me that I am mad.",
      "verse": "13:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 52.748,
      "end": 56.277,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass after Abinadi had spoken these words",
      "verse": "13:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 56.457,
      "end": 60.172,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the people of king Noah durst not lay their hands on him,",
      "verse": "13:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 60.352,
      "end": 62.813,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Spirit of the Lord was upon him;",
      "verse": "13:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 62.993,
      "end": 65.501,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his face shone with exceeding luster,",
      "verse": "13:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 65.681,
      "end": 70.093,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as Moses' did while in the mount of Sinai, while speaking with the Lord.",
      "verse": "13:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 70.773,
      "end": 73.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he spake with power and authority from God;",
      "verse": "13:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 74.018,
      "end": 76.294,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he continued his words, saying:",
      "verse": "13:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 76.974,
      "end": 79.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye see that ye have not power to slay me,",
      "verse": "13:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 79.476,
      "end": 81.38,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I finish my message.",
      "verse": "13:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 81.56,
      "end": 84.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and I perceive that it cuts you to your hearts",
      "verse": "13:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 84.619,
      "end": 88.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because I tell you the truth concerning your iniquities.",
      "verse": "13:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 88.782,
      "end": 93.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and my words fill you with wonder and amazement, and with anger.",
      "verse": "13:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 93.734,
      "end": 95.638,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I finish my message;",
      "verse": "13:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 95.818,
      "end": 98.326,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then it matters not whither I go,",
      "verse": "13:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 98.506,
      "end": 100.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it so be that I am saved.",
      "verse": "13:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 101.136,
      "end": 102.761,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But this much I tell you,",
      "verse": "13:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 102.941,
      "end": 105.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what you do with me, after this,",
      "verse": "13:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 105.443,
      "end": 109.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be as a type and a shadow of things which are to come.",
      "verse": "13:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 109.931,
      "end": 113.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I read unto you the remainder of the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "13:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 113.687,
      "end": 116.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I perceive that they are not written in your hearts;",
      "verse": "13:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 117.118,
      "end": 121.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I perceive that ye have studied and taught iniquity the most part of your lives.",
      "verse": "13:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 122.488,
      "end": 125.089,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, ye remember that I said unto you:",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 125.269,
      "end": 128.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou shalt not make unto thee any graven image,",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 128.421,
      "end": 131.625,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or any likeness of things which are in heaven above,",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 131.805,
      "end": 133.895,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or which are in the earth beneath,",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 134.075,
      "end": 136.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or which are in the water under the earth.",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 137.309,
      "end": 138.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again:",
      "verse": "13:13",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 138.696,
      "end": 141.482,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou shalt not bow down thyself unto them,",
      "verse": "13:13",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 141.662,
      "end": 143.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor serve them;",
      "verse": "13:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 143.189,
      "end": 145.929,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I the Lord thy God am a jealous God,",
      "verse": "13:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 146.109,
      "end": 153.725,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "visiting the iniquities of the fathers upon the children, unto the third and fourth generations of them that hate me;",
      "verse": "13:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 154.405,
      "end": 159.188,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And showing mercy unto thousands of them that love me and keep my commandments.",
      "verse": "13:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 159.868,
      "end": 162.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou shalt not take the name of the Lord thy God in vain;",
      "verse": "13:15",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 163.159,
      "end": 167.106,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord will not hold him guiltless that taketh his name in vain.",
      "verse": "13:15",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 167.786,
      "end": 170.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Remember the sabbath day, to keep it holy.",
      "verse": "13:16",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 170.881,
      "end": 174.132,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Six days shalt thou labor, and do all thy work;",
      "verse": "13:17",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 174.812,
      "end": 176.252,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But the seventh day,",
      "verse": "13:18",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 176.432,
      "end": 178.661,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the sabbath of the Lord thy God,",
      "verse": "13:18",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 178.841,
      "end": 180.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou shalt not do any work,",
      "verse": "13:18",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 180.971,
      "end": 183.386,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou, nor thy son, nor thy daughter,",
      "verse": "13:18",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 183.566,
      "end": 187.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thy man-servant, nor thy maid-servant, nor thy cattle,",
      "verse": "13:18",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 187.461,
      "end": 190.015,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor thy stranger that is within thy gates;",
      "verse": "13:18",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 190.695,
      "end": 193.667,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For in six days the Lord made heaven and earth,",
      "verse": "13:19",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 193.847,
      "end": 194.962,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the sea,",
      "verse": "13:19",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 195.142,
      "end": 196.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all that in them is;",
      "verse": "13:19",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 197.133,
      "end": 199.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore the Lord blessed the sabbath day,",
      "verse": "13:19",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 200.053,
      "end": 201.4,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hallowed it.",
      "verse": "13:19",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 202.08,
      "end": 204.309,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Honor thy father and thy mother,",
      "verse": "13:20",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 204.489,
      "end": 207.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thy days may be long upon the land",
      "verse": "13:20",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 207.363,
      "end": 209.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which the Lord thy God giveth thee.",
      "verse": "13:20",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 210.319,
      "end": 211.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou shalt not kill.",
      "verse": "13:21",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 212.578,
      "end": 214.761,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou shalt not commit adultery.",
      "verse": "13:22",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 214.941,
      "end": 216.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou shalt not steal.",
      "verse": "13:22",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 217.154,
      "end": 220.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou shalt not bear false witness against thy neighbor.",
      "verse": "13:23",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 221.085,
      "end": 223.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou shalt not covet thy neighbor's house,",
      "verse": "13:24",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 223.541,
      "end": 226.374,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou shalt not covet thy neighbor's wife,",
      "verse": "13:24",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 226.554,
      "end": 229.015,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor his man-servant, nor his maid-servant,",
      "verse": "13:24",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 229.195,
      "end": 231.053,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor his ox, nor his ass,",
      "verse": "13:24",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 231.233,
      "end": 233.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor anything that is thy neighbor's.",
      "verse": "13:24",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 234.328,
      "end": 238.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after Abinadi had made an end of these sayings",
      "verse": "13:25",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 238.641,
      "end": 240.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he said unto them:",
      "verse": "13:25",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 240.539,
      "end": 244.394,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Have ye taught this people that they should observe to do all these things",
      "verse": "13:25",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 244.574,
      "end": 246.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for to keep these commandments?",
      "verse": "13:25",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 247.437,
      "end": 248.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you, Nay;",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 249.103,
      "end": 250.543,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for if ye had,",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 250.723,
      "end": 253.463,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord would not have caused me to come forth",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 253.643,
      "end": 256.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to prophesy evil concerning this people.",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 257.156,
      "end": 260.5,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now ye have said that salvation cometh by the law of Moses.",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 260.68,
      "end": 261.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 262.16,
      "end": 266.99,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it is expedient that ye should keep the law of Moses as yet;",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 267.17,
      "end": 269.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I say unto you, that the time shall come",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 269.951,
      "end": 273.388,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when it shall no more be expedient to keep the law of Moses.",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 274.068,
      "end": 278.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And moreover, I say unto you, that salvation doth not come by the law alone;",
      "verse": "13:28",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 278.846,
      "end": 281.075,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were it not for the atonement,",
      "verse": "13:28",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 281.255,
      "end": 286.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which God himself shall make for the sins and iniquities of his people,",
      "verse": "13:28",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 286.358,
      "end": 288.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they must unavoidably perish,",
      "verse": "13:28",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 288.906,
      "end": 291.135,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "notwithstanding the law of Moses.",
      "verse": "13:28",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 291.815,
      "end": 293.487,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I say unto you",
      "verse": "13:29",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 293.667,
      "end": 301.701,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it was expedient that there should be a law given to the children of Israel, yea, even a very strict law;",
      "verse": "13:29",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 301.881,
      "end": 304.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they were a stiffnecked people,",
      "verse": "13:29",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 304.476,
      "end": 306.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "quick to do iniquity,",
      "verse": "13:29",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 306.421,
      "end": 308.789,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and slow to remember the Lord their God;",
      "verse": "13:29",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 309.469,
      "end": 311.745,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore there was a law given them,",
      "verse": "13:30",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 311.925,
      "end": 315.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, a law of performances and of ordinances,",
      "verse": "13:30",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 315.402,
      "end": 318.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a law which they were to observe strictly from day to day,",
      "verse": "13:30",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 319.111,
      "end": 323.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to keep them in remembrance of God and their duty towards him.",
      "verse": "13:30",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 323.738,
      "end": 325.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I say unto you",
      "verse": "13:31",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 325.822,
      "end": 328.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that all these things were types of things to come.",
      "verse": "13:31",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 329.521,
      "end": 331.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, did they understand the law?",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 331.93,
      "end": 333.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you,",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 333.596,
      "end": 336.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nay, they did not all understand the law;",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 336.377,
      "end": 339.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this because of the hardness of their hearts;",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 339.576,
      "end": 343.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they understood not that there could not any man be saved",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 343.843,
      "end": 346.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it were through the redemption of God.",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 347.309,
      "end": 352.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, did not Moses prophesy unto them concerning the coming of the Messiah,",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 352.458,
      "end": 354.826,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that God should redeem his people?",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 355.006,
      "end": 357.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and even all the prophets",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 357.276,
      "end": 360.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who have prophesied ever since the world began\u2014",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 360.707,
      "end": 364.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have they not spoken more or less concerning these things?",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 364.963,
      "end": 369.561,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Have they not said that God himself should come down among the children of men,",
      "verse": "13:34",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 369.741,
      "end": 372.109,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and take upon him the form of man,",
      "verse": "13:34",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 372.289,
      "end": 375.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and go forth in mighty power upon the face of the earth?",
      "verse": "13:34",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 376.359,
      "end": 378.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and have they not said also",
      "verse": "13:35",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 378.768,
      "end": 382.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he should bring to pass the resurrection of the dead,",
      "verse": "13:35",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 382.431,
      "end": 385.96,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he, himself, should be oppressed and afflicted?",
      "verse": "13:35",
      "lineIndex": 129
    }
  ]
}